WEBVTT

00:00:00.116 --> 00:00:05.754
Performance appraisals

00:00:05.804 --> 00:00:12.238
Open HR and Staff, then Performance. This page keeps every staff review.

00:00:15.572 --> 00:00:17.606
Press New Appraisal.

00:00:19.522 --> 00:00:21.601
Choose the staff member.

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:28.989
Set the review period start and end dates.

00:00:35.170 --> 00:00:39.744
Click the stars to give a rating. Four stars means Good.

00:00:40.818 --> 00:00:44.106
Write the strengths and the goals for the next period.

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:05.074
Press Create. The review now shows in the list with its rating.

00:01:10.264 --> 00:01:14.949
Appraisal saved
